### HTTP тестове за ExamRegistration.Api (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio)
# Токени се генерират локално (офлайн):
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project src/ExamRegistration.Api --name ivan.petrov --role Student --scope registrations:write -o token
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project src/ExamRegistration.Api --name admin --role Admin -o token

@host = http://localhost:5080
@studentToken = PASTE_STUDENT_TOKEN
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 1. Health check (анонимен) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Списък с изпити (анонимен) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/exams

### 3. Записване без токен -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facultyNumber": "121221001", "studentName": "Иван Петров", "studentEmail": "ivan@tu-sofia.bg", "examId": "PRS-2026-01" }

### 4. Записване с валиден токен на студент -> 202 Accepted
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facultyNumber": "121221001", "studentName": "Иван Петров", "studentEmail": "ivan@tu-sofia.bg", "examId": "PRS-2026-01" }

### 5. Невалидни данни -> 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facultyNumber": "12", "studentName": "", "studentEmail": "not-an-email", "examId": "NOPE" }

### 6. Изпит с изтекъл срок -> 202, но Processor го отказва (виж лога на Notifier)
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facultyNumber": "121221002", "studentName": "Мария Иванова", "studentEmail": "maria@tu-sofia.bg", "examId": "MATH-2025-09" }

### 7. Всички заявки - само Admin -> 200 (със студентски токен -> 403)
GET {{host}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
